+# Plan
+
+## 1. Tests
+
+- [ ] 1.1 getAdapter loads a function handle and a name in any case (test/unit/adapters/adapters.js) [AC-1]
+- [ ] 1.2 getAdapter picks the first available adapter of a list (test/unit/adapters/adapters.js) [AC-2]
+- [ ] 1.3 getAdapter reports an unavailable and an unsupported adapter (test/unit/adapters/adapters.js) [AC-3]
+
+## 2. Fix
+
+- [ ] 2.1 Resolve each entry of the list and collect the reasons for the rejected ones (lib/adapters/adapters.js)
+- [ ] 2.2 Make the default adapter the list ['xhr', 'http'] (lib/defaults/index.js)
